OL,3,GNEWSATeachers continue city's 'longest
OL,4,Aschool strike'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeachers and support staff at a primary
OL,7,Fand nursery are set to strike again in
OL,8,Fwhat their union is calling the
OL,9,Flongest-ever industrial dispute at a
OL,10,Fschool in Nottingham.
OL,12,FMembers of the National Education Union
OL,13,F(NEU) at Forest Fields Primary first
OL,14,Fwent on strike in June and have now
OL,15,Ftaken action over 25 days.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
