OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSATeachers continue city's 'longest
OL,4,Aschool strike'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Miller, a teaching assistant at
OL,7,Fthe nursery and one of the union's
OL,8,Frepresentatives at the school, said
OL,9,Fthey had walked out over a lack of
OL,10,Fsupport staff in classrooms and
OL,11,Ffrustration with the school's
OL,12,Fmanagement.
OL,14,FNottingham City Council, which manages
OL,15,Fthe school, said it "remains committed
OL,16,Fto a resolution" and was regularly
OL,17,Fmeeting both the school and union.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
